\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\lang2057\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. My soul, praise the Lord!
\par O God, Thou art great :  
\par In fathomless works
\par Thyself Thou dost hide.
\par Before Thy dark wisdom
\par And power uncreate,
\par Man's mind, that dare praise Thee,
\par In fear must abide.
\par \pard\fi720   
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. This earth where we dwell,
\par That journey in space,
\par With air as a robe
\par Thou wrappest around:
\par Her countries she turneth
\par To greet the sun's face,
\par Then plungeth to slumber
\par In darkness profound.
\par    \tab  
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. All seemth so sure,
\par Yet nought doth remain:
\par Unending their change
\par Obeys Thy decree.
\par The valleys ocean
\par Stand up a dry plain,
\par Thou whelmest the mountains
\par Beneath the deep sea. 
\par \pard\li60 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. The clouds gather rain
\par \pard And melt o'er the land,
\par Then back to the sun
\par Are drawn by his shine: 
\par Whereby the corn springeth 
\par Through toil of man's hand,
\par And vineyards that gladden 
\par His heart with good wine. 
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. All beast of the field 
\par Rejoice for their life:
\par Among the tall trees
\par Are light birds on wing: 
\par With strains of their music 
\par The woodlands are rife:
\par They nest in thick branches
\par And welcome sweet spring. 
\par    
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 6\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 6. Lo, there is Thy sea,
\par Whose bosom below 
\par With creatures doth teem, 
\par Scaled fishes and finned.
\par Above, the ships laden 
\par With merchandise go
\par Nor fear the wild waters. 
\par Nor rage of rude wind. 
\par \pard\li60 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 7\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 7. O God, Thou art great!
\par \pard No greatness I see,
\par Except Thee alone,
\par Thy praise to record.
\par On all Thy works musing 
\par My pleasure shall be
\par My joy shall be singing:
\par My soul, praise the Lord! 
\par \pard\fi-660\li720\tx720\f1 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

